# Normalize line endings: store LF in the repo and check out LF everywhere,
# regardless of the local core.autocrlf setting (Windows machines default it
# to true, which produced constant "LF will be replaced by CRLF" warnings and
# would break bin/deploy.sh if a CRLF copy were ever committed).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets, if any are ever added.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
